{"id":"n28026-1-23","stage":0,"title":"여행 · 旅行","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28026-1-23-1","ko":"여름휴가 때 여행 간다면서?","zh":"听说你夏天休假时要去旅行？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여름휴가","meaning":"暑假，暑期休假","explanation":"여름휴가：暑假，暑期休假","readings":[{"term":"여름휴가","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22667","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간다면서?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f326418aa384e84","term":"여름휴가","zh":"暑假，暑期休假","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3","entryId":"22667","definition":"在夏季上学或上班的人在一定期间休息。","pronunciation":["여름휴가"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d1228bab82c473544c0c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28026-1-23-2","ko":"응. 어디로 갈지 아직 고민 중이야.","zh":"嗯，还在考虑去哪里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈지","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고민","meaning":"苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","explanation":"고민：苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","readings":[{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19225","senseId":"1","lemma":"고민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중이야.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","a